nimux (1.0.7) unstable; urgency=medium

  * BloodHound offline analysis (nimux bh): full chain annotations for
    ForceChangePassword, WriteAccountRestrictions, AddKeyCredentialLink,
    GenericAll, GenericWrite, WriteDacl, WriteOwner, AllowedToAct.
  * Direct control rights section added to --interesting and --high-value.
  * Path deduplication: same node sequence collapses with Alternate routes note.
  * Improved plain-language edge descriptions for ACL abuse edges.

